        <h2><a name="1"></a>A. Pari-Mutuel Pools</h2>

        <h3><a name="2"></a>1. Pari-Mutuel Local Pools</h3>

        <p>
          Dividend will be shared by the number of winning combinations of a
          particular pool. Winners will share the percentage of pool payout in
          proportion to their winning stakes.
        </p>
        <p>Percentage of Dividend for each Pool</p>
        <table width="95%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#CCCCCC">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>
