        <h3><a name="10"></a>3. All Up or Cross Pool All Up Betting</h3>
        <p>
          You can enjoy greater flexibility by choosing All Up or Cross Pool
          All Up bet. Simply by placing bets in the same or different betting
          pools for 2 races to a maximum of 6 races. Any dividend entitlement
          from a winning Leg will be automatically carried forward and
          reinvested in the subsequent Leg specified in your bet selection.
        </p>
        <p></p>
        <table width="95%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#CCCCCC">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1">
                  <tbody>
                    <tr valign="TOP" bgcolor="#666666">
                      <td height="10">
                        <div align="center">
                          <b>
                            <font color="#FFFFFF"></font>
                          </b>
                        </div>
                      </td>
                      <td height="10">
                        <div align="center">
                          <b>
                            <font color="#FFFFFF" class="td_header">All Up Betting <br>(same betting pool in each
                              leg)<br></font>
                          </b>
                        </div>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <div align="center">
                          <b>
                            <font color="#FFFFFF" class="td_header">Cross Pool All Up Betting<br>(different
                              betting pools in each leg allowed)<br></font>
                          </b>
                        </div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr valign="TOP" bgcolor="#DBE8F3">
                      <td width="15%"><b>Select 2 to 3 races</b><br></td>
                      <td width="22%">
                        &nbsp;•&nbsp;Forecast, Trio<br>
                        <br>&nbsp;e.g. Forecast → Forecast <br>
                      </td>
                      <td width="27%">
                        &nbsp;•&nbsp;Win, Place, Quinella, Quinella Place,
                        Forecast, Trio<br>
                        <br>&nbsp;e.g. Forecast → Trio → Win
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr valign="TOP" bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
                      <td>
                        <b>Select 2 to 6 races<br> </b>
                      </td>
                      <td width="27%">
                        &nbsp;•&nbsp;Win, Place, Quinella, Quinella Place<br>
                        <br>&nbsp;e.g. Win → Win
                      </td>
                      <td width="27%">
                        &nbsp;•&nbsp;Win, Place, Quinella, Quinella Place<br>
                        <br>&nbsp;e.g. Win → Place → Quinella
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p></p>
        <br>
        <p class="backtotop"><a href="#top" class="backtotop">^ Top</a></p>

        <h3><a name="11"></a>4. About Flexi Bet</h3>
        <p>
          'Flexi Bet' minimum unit bet amount is now lowered to $1, you can
          make use of the same betting amount with more combinations, and
          master your betting strategy with a better chance to win.
          <br><br>The minimum amount per unit bet of different betting
          pools are as follows:
        </p>

